@startuml
' Sequence enrollment — docs/proposal/06-proses-bisnis-dan-alur.md §6.3
autonumber
actor Laboran as Op
participant "Vue SPA" as Web
participant "Core API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Op -> Web : Pilih siswa + capture 3-10 frame
Web -> API : POST /enrollments/captures (bytes di memori)
API -> API : YuNet detect lokal + SFace embed lokal\n+ quality gate + anti multi-wajah
API -> API : Cek mirip siswa lain (warning 0,85)
API -> DB : Simpan max 5 template terenkripsi + model name-version

note over API
  Bytes gambar dibuang setelah request;
  tanpa kolom image di DB.
end note

API --> Web : Status enrolled + audit
@enduml
